(7783988, 1295604, 12200, '<td valign="top">
I think I would have opted for a softer editing aesthetic--purely personal taste. But in terms of addressing the theme of this challenge, this is easily my favorite of the bunch. It really conveys the vastness of the space in front of the subject and evokes awe and wonder. If only there was something on the horizon in the distance to serve as an exclamation point on the visual movement...</td>', 'I think I would have opted for a softer editing aesthetic--purely personal taste. But in terms of addressing the theme of this challenge, this is easily my favorite of the bunch. It really conveys the vastness of the space in front of the subject and evokes awe and wonder. If only there was something on the horizon in the distance to serve as an exclamation point on the visual movement...', '2025-07-05 18:34:57.000000', NULL, 1),
(7783989, 1295516, 12200, '<td valign="top">
